WEBVTT

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:30.665
by an understandable fear
of nuclear weapons.

00:03:30.665 --> 00:03:32.083
And I get it.

00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:36.879
It must have been terrifying
to grow up in the '50s and '60s

00:03:36.921 --> 00:03:38.547
fearing a nuclear attack.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.550
But here's the problem.

00:03:42.093 --> 00:03:45.805
Their logic was: nuclear bombs are bad,

00:03:45.805 --> 00:03:49.225
therefore nuclear energy is bad.

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:54.730
Which, if you think about it,
is like saying: the electric chair is bad,

00:03:54.772 --> 00:03:58.234
therefore electricity is bad.

00:03:59.485 --> 00:04:03.698
The case against nuclear power
was never based on science,